WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:02.240
I'll be taking this one.

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:04.360
Damn! You got me!

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:06.980
Four years ago, my buddies and I

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.410
Not again!

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.730
were serving under some spoiled noble moron.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.010
Ryce, hurry up!

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:13.450
What's going on, Maccahee?

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:15.200
Look. Over there.

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:20.460
Cantil's squad?

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:22.270
Don't they look awesome?

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.150
We had hoped to join Cantil's squad,

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.070
but we weren't anywhere near good enough.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:32.930
Hey, we're going one more round!

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:33.910
Coming!

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:35.840
I won't lose this time!

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:39.600
So while we were on standby 
in the reserves...

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:45.650
I'm sorry.

00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:49.080
What?!

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:51.300
Our nation fell.

00:00:56.710 --> 00:00:58.040
From then on...

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:07.750
Ryce, hurry!

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:13.970
We spent our days on the run from those 
trying to finish off our people.

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:20.090
The serfs got Robin and Lanau first.

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:25.590
And then bandits killed 
Cotomay, Bittsburgh, Botom...

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:39.690
and Clius.

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:50.180
Clius was a really fun guy.

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:56.210
On the eleventh day, my best friend Maccahee 
joined them after a fight over food.

00:01:56.390 --> 00:02:01.370
On the nineteenth day, Canalun died 
of necrosis caused by malnutrition,

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:00.890
<i>Ryce-san sounds so cheerful 
telling this story,</i>

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.140
<i>but what he saw...</i>

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:03.980
and then only I was left.

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:06.470
<i>...was hell.</i>

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:09.860
When I made it out of the country on day 25,

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:12.630
<i>How did he go from such despair 
to smiling in just four years?</i>

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:12.700
I was like, "Yes! I'm finally out of there!"

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:13.580
Man,

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:16.640
that's too much detail, with your buddies' 
names and the exact days and everything.

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:20.810
We'll, we're talking about the best 
memories in our lives, right?

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:23.560
I thought more detail would be better.

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:26.410
Damn, that's your best memory?

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:27.630
How scary is that?

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:29.760
It is, isn't it?

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:33.910
So our upcoming victory celebration 
will be your future number one, right?

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:36.430
I'll do my best. Ow, ow...

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:37.330
Rootin' for ya.

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:40.300
Okay, Iu-chan, you're up next.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:43.250
Huh? The best memory in my life?

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:45.480
Wait, is it me? Is it meeting me?

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:46.400
No!

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:32.240
Thanzamer-san!

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:37.940
<i>This is...</i>

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:42.330
Three of them.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.260
No time for hiding your eyes.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:47.210
Yeah!

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:48.070
Right!

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:52.030
I thought these guys were on the 
other side of the mountain!

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:54.530
Did they really swim across 
the ocean to get here?

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:00.170
It's rock-hard!

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:12.450
<b>Dead</b>

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:12.450
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:12.450
<b>Shindou Iu</b>

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:12.210
With three of them, 
we can't get an opening!

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:20.210
<b>Dead</b>

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:20.210
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:20.210
<b>Torii Keita</b>

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:20.220
Damn it! I died!

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:21.830
Cantil-san!

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:22.430
Stay back!

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:26.410
No!

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.390
Cantil-san!

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:38.820
Whoa... It went right through!

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:41.150
That wasn't the one I was aiming for, but...

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:44.280
<i>He finished it?</i>

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:49.100
<i>That's...</i>

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.840
<i>the bow from the hero's world!</i>

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:13.500
<i>Damn, it still takes too long to reload.</i>

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:21.020
General Cantil!

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:24.440
Hey, orcs! This way!

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:25.640
Ryce-san?

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:29.940
Nice! He's trying to scatter 
the orcs by distracting them!

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:31.560
Bring it—

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.420
Nice one, Ryce-san!

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:00.180
Take this!

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:20.750
You saved me.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:24.640
I'm honored I could be 
of use to you, General.

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:27.730
Though I can't attack, 
since they'll kill me if I get close...

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:30.760
I told you to stop calling me "General."

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:32.780
I'm a mercenary now, just like you.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:35.650
You got it, Great General!

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:38.310
Having Ryce-san here kinda 
lightens things up, huh?

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:42.470
Aw, I just can't stand it 
when the mood's all gloomy.

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:44.030
I'm a wimp, you know.

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:48.020
What? Someone who was a wimp 
wouldn't trip like that!

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:54.060
Someone, take care of him!

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:04.250
They got the jump on us,

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.550
but we can still take this back.

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:11.090
<b>Väikedaam Cave</b>

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:11.090
The wounded

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.100
will be carried to the Väikedaam cave,

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:15.010
<b>Väikedaam Cave</b>

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:14.660
where they will be treated.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:17.430
<b>Eastern High Ground</b>

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:20.850
<b>Eastern High Ground</b>

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:20.280
All those available to fight...

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:22.770
<b>Western High Ground</b>

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:25.980
<b>Western High Ground</b>

00:08:23.030 --> 00:08:25.280
will return to their posts and stand by.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:27.900
<b>Stronghold</b>

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:32.700
<b>Stronghold</b>

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:35.390
Ryce-san and I will act as decoys.

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:37.480
Aim it with this alignment.

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:38.410
O-Okay.

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:42.730
It's exciting to have a 
weapon that's just for us!

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:45.600
I'm gonna call you "Orc Eater"!

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:48.330
Do you think we can hit them, though?

00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:53.140
Don't worry. We'll run slowly 
to make them easier to target.

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:54.640
Isn't that super dangerous?!

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:57.520
Please make sure you do your 
best to run from them!

00:08:57.520 --> 00:08:59.080
We'll make sure our shots land!

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:01.660
All right, then, I'll take you up on that.

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:09.950
Running away is

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:12.380
the one thing I can do, after all.

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:15.790
Orcs incoming!

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:23.010
This way!

00:09:26.430 --> 00:09:28.070
This way, ogre!

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:30.880
They split up!

00:09:33.850 --> 00:09:34.940
I'm taking aim.

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:36.050
Okay.

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:40.300
Firing!

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.380
Roger!

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:50.080
Now! Take aim!

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:53.750
Congratula.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:56.360
You have reached rank 10 in 
your Wizard (Heat) occupa.

00:09:57.140 --> 00:09:58.270
You serious?!

00:09:58.270 --> 00:09:59.690
Time to spi.

00:10:01.170 --> 00:10:04.080
Please! Please! Please! Please!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.580
<b>Hunter</b>

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.580
<b>Thief</b>

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.580
<b>Warrior (Sword)</b>

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:07.570
Bam! Hunter!

00:10:10.550 --> 00:10:14.000
Yes! I got Hunter!

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:17.630
I'm literally Blue from 
<i>Go! Majiha Super Express!</i>

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:21.380
Majiha Blue is the cool lady 
who never misses a shot!

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:25.960
Her transformation sequence that uses 
a staggering 6,000 drawings is legendary!

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:26.840
Until next ti.

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:27.860
Her catchphrase is...

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:30.780
"I will cross sea, sky, and time...

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:33.380
to pierce...

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:36.570
your heart!"

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:37.430
Huh?

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:38.270
Uh...

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:41.380
Hey!

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:44.120
I could use some help, too!

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:46.500
On my way!

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:48.560
Wait for me!

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:54.050
m 0 0 l 260 0 l 260 200 l 0 200

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:54.050
[Orc Eater]

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:54.050
Since trees do not
naturally grow on Jiffon
Island, arrows can't be
made there (wood
must be imported), 
so it fires iron bullets
instead of arrows.
This means a string
much stronger than those used for arrows is
required to make the bullets fly straight, so its
string is so heavy that a reel is needed to pull it.

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.980
No orcs are approaching 
the stronghold anymore.

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:14.990
I guess they've learned that it's dangerous.

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:20.900
I'm going to see if I can 
divert one away by myself.

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:23.400
You heroes have so much energy.

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:25.320
I'm already exhausted.

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:26.650
Be careful.

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:27.600
I will.

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:36.580
<i>My first real one-on-one battle 
might not be far off...</i>

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:44.470
<i>So I need to see if this thing works.</i>

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:49.600
<i>I can do this!</i>

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:52.290
<i>Shit!</i>

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:59.630
Damn... Now I'm stuck like 
this for 50 seconds?

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:05.750
What's it doing?

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:07.620
Wait, no way!

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:15.330
Take cover! Take cover!

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.190
I'm shooting!

00:12:23.190 --> 00:12:24.110
Okay!

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:26.840
No! The right! Incoming from the right!

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:27.680
Huh?!

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:32.420
They're throwing from this side now, too!

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:37.950
Please hit him!

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:47.700
No!

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:03.760
They're...

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:05.480
gonna get inside!

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:21.900
Ryce-san!

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:37.540
<i>This time...</i>

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:39.300
<i>I'll hit dead center!</i>

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.910
We gotta prepare the next shot!

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:53.150
R-Right!

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:09.480
Hit him!

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:27.700
Ryce-san!

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:40.090
He...y...

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:44.480
Did we... beat them?

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:48.080
Yes, thanks to you.

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:55.040
This is what happens when I 
fight instead of running...

00:14:56.260 --> 00:14:59.020
After I avoided death all this time...

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:01.910
I'm so weak...

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:06.350
<i>Right up until the very end,</i>

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:10.590
<i>he didn't let the mood among those 
of us left behind become glum.</i>

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:17.260
You're not weak at all!

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:19.360
You're not!

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:23.340
I finally stood and fought...

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:27.850
Too late, though...

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:37.110
You can brag to your best 
friend and war buddies...

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:40.330
that you got to fight 
alongside General Cantil.

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:45.540
I will. You don't need... to tell me...

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:00.080
Report!

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:04.320
The earthen walls of the stronghold 
are breached. Nine villagers...

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.070
and Ryce have died!

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:11.820
Got it.

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:15.710
Keita, go back them up at the stronghold.

00:16:15.710 --> 00:16:16.890
Roger!

00:16:21.550 --> 00:16:24.580
Report! Ryce-san is dead!

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:25.600
What?!

00:16:30.560 --> 00:16:33.760
I owe you. We shall meet in the underworld.

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:46.260
It's our last shot!

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:47.610
Please land!

00:16:52.310 --> 00:16:54.130
Yeah!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:11.370
Abandon the stronghold!

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:14.300
Everyone, split up and get away from here!

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:18.150
There are five orcs left.

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:19.800
I'm gonna report to all posts!

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:22.210
Great. Countin' on ya.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.110
<i>Five left...</i>

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.780
<i>There are still more we haven't seen yet?</i>

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:28.640
<i>Are they waiting to ambush us somewhere?</i>

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:34.780
<b>Offer the Jiffon Buffo at Väikdamania.
(Time limit: 20 days)</b>

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:34.780
<b>Quest Time!</b>

00:17:29.140 --> 00:17:31.470
<i>And the quest we're here for...</i>

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:34.780
<i>To offer a Jiffon Buffo at Väikdamania,</i>

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:39.120
<i>we need to get a Buffo to offer 
at the harvest festival.</i>

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:42.490
<i>To make that possible, 
we need to eradicate the orcs.</i>

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:46.400
<i>And the ones we absolutely can't 
allow to be attacked are...</i>

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:49.130
The Väikedaam!

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:52.370
I'm going to provide backup 
at the Väikedaam cave!

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:57.120
What do we do with this? 
We're all out of bullets.

00:17:57.120 --> 00:17:58.060
Report!

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:01.230
The blacksmith near the eastern high ground

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:03.320
is workin' on an iron stake!

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:07.720
Seriously? The master's still there?

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:09.330
Nice timing!

00:18:09.610 --> 00:18:11.680
Let's go get more bullets.

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:16.600
Yeah... Either we let the 
islanders shoot them,

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:19.470
or the four of us will go get the bullets

00:18:19.470 --> 00:18:21.150
and then head for the Väikedaam cave.

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:21.780
Yeah.

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:22.670
Got it.

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:07.140
Five orcs left...

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:09.380
The enemy numbers don't add up.

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:10.550
Yeah.

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:15.120
Also, no one's seen the 
queen yet, have they?

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:18.130
Right. That's what bothers me.

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:21.040
Iu, what do you think the queen is after?

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:23.180
Let me think...

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:26.180
The ship carrying the children!

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:27.810
Let's go check it out.

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:33.670
Orcs!

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:37.930
Two at once!

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:40.860
Report!

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:42.440
The stronghold is abandoned!

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:44.790
The four heroes are comin' this way!

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:46.030
All right.

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:48.860
Katz, Thanza, we're gonna buy them time.

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:06.890
She really is here...

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:08.090
The queen!

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:17.430
What do you want? I'm warming 
up to go for a swim.

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:18.650
You perverts.

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:23.400
So you really are after the ship!

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:24.980
That a problem?

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:28.410
You killed my children...

00:20:32.630 --> 00:20:35.240
so I will avenge them by killing yours.

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:38.080
We won't let you do that!

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:40.910
You were the ones who 
approached me with a pact,

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:43.510
and the ones who broke it.

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:44.430
What?

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:52.470
Damn...

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:56.610
Evil minions sure are a 
pain in the ass to beat.

00:20:56.930 --> 00:20:58.400
Evil minions?

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:01.010
Well, we're heroes, aren't we?

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:03.430
Heroes are the good guys,

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:05.920
so they're the bad guys 
we have to defeat, right?

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:07.830
Wrong.

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:11.680
This started when the 
islanders were being eaten,

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:14.220
so they proposed a pact with 
the orcs not to kill them.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:17.810
The orcs didn't need such a pact at all,

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:19.790
but they agreed to it anyway.

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:23.670
But because the orcs grew so much in number,

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:27.060
the islanders realized there 
wouldn't be enough Buffo,

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:30.520
so before they could be eaten themselves,

00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:34.890
they made the decision to kill all the orcs.

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:36.850
If you look at it objectively,

00:21:36.850 --> 00:21:39.310
the islanders are obviously the bad guys.

00:21:40.210 --> 00:21:42.730
I will destroy you all, just as you wish!

